cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Bridge2AI Voice REDCap
abstract: >-
  REDCap data dictionary, metadata, and protocol documentation for the
  Bridge2AI-Voice project — "Voice as a Biomarker of Health." Covers
  adult and pediatric protocols across voice, mood, respiratory,
  neurological, and control populations.
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
